# 根目录默认排除，逐项开放技术入口；本机总入口与协作资料仍保留本机。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/TECHNICAL.md
!/main.py
!/pyproject.toml
!/requirements.lock

# 正式运行包仅开放Python源码和明确列出的运行数据。
!/time_maze/
/time_maze/**
!/time_maze/**/
!/time_maze/**/*.py
!/time_maze/data/level.json
!/time_maze/data/rules.json
!/time_maze/data/text.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/a_sword_chamber.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/b_maze_crossroads.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/c_cargo_corridor.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/d_night_gate.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/e_chicken_yard.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/f_nest_passage.json
!/time_maze/data/areas/g_meadow.json

# 辅助根逐区开放，制作资料不因技术目录存在而一并进入Git。
!/support/
/support/*
!/support/standards/
/support/standards/*
!/support/standards/project-scope.md
!/support/standards/python-pygame.md
# 同版本纯技术规范副本经正文审阅可纳入；本项目不自动复制权威正文。
!/support/standards/general-coding-standard.md
!/support/technical/
/support/technical/*
!/support/technical/requirements.md
!/support/technical/architecture.md
!/support/technical/packaging.md
!/support/technical/roadmap.md
!/support/technical/reference-adoption.md
!/support/technical/graybox-api.md
!/support/technical/verification.md

# 后续正式测试和工具的Python文件仍须审阅正文并同步检查器允许集合。
!/support/tests/
/support/tests/**
!/support/tests/**/
!/support/tests/**/*.py
!/support/tools/
/support/tools/**
!/support/tools/**/
!/support/tools/**/*.py
/support/tools/output/

# 本机混合入口、全部制作资料、虚拟环境和产物始终排除。
/support/production/
/README.md
/AGENTS.md
/LIFE_PLAN_LINK.md
.venv/
.venv-game/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
